# detail
Number of changes: 1

1. Modified | Method implementation code block
   Changed the implementation of `equal` from a type check and collinearity test to directly returning the result of `self.equals(other)`.
   The original implementation included:

   * Conditional statement: return `False` when `other` was not a `Line`;
   * Return statement: return `Point.is_collinear(self.p1, other.p1, self.p2, other.p2)`.

   The new implementation includes:

   * Return statement: return `self.equals(other)`.
